      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "O'KEEFE (1) is a talented type who boasts a strong winning strike-rate at this distance. Has been on speed to score at his last couple of runs. Last start won The Meadows in a handy 30.19 beating Dewana Missile. Has a strong record out of this box with five wins and two minor placings from eight starts. Looks the one to beat. MATCHBOX BEAST (3) ran below best last time finishing fourth (25.69) over 450m at Shepparton from Box 6. Comes through a solid form race last start. Leading chance. PANTHER'S WAY (6) has a strong winning strike-rate this journey here having won two of three starts. Scored by a neck last time (29.85) in a Grade 5 over 515m at this track. Can feature with the right run. INDIAN PRINCE (7) is building a nice picket fence and can add to the tally.",
